  "title": "¿Por qué te crujen los nudillos? Una burbuja de gas",
  "source": "Fuentes: Kawchuk et al., PLOS ONE 2015, «Real-Time Visualization of Joint Cavitation» · Pharmaceutical Journal · Banner Health · Unger, Arthritis & Rheumatism 1998, «Does knuckle cracking lead to arthritis of the fingers?» · Improbable Research, Ig Nobel de Medicina 2009 · Scientific American · Harvard Health",
